cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IVF in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "IVF: offline acceptance validation and evidence for simulator experiments"
abstract: >-
  IVF compares two simulator capture bundles against a declarative,
  predeclared acceptance contract. Before any oracle result is allowed to
  decide a verdict it runs a validity pass over the required comparison
  controls, recording missing controls as unverifiable rather than as
  matches. It emits a single typed verdict plus a sealed evidence directory
  whose per-file digests can be re-verified independently.
authors:
  - family-names: Guenena
    given-names: Yusuf
version: 0.1.0rc2
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/yusufdxb/ivf"
keywords:
  - simulation
  - validation
  - acceptance testing
  - reproducibility
  - robotics
